Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.30,0:00:03.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, of course. I still cannot believe{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N当然 我还是不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.82,0:00:07.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that I'm doing a press conference with a Grand Slam trophy by my side.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N带着大满贯奖杯开发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:11.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it's been one of my biggest dreams in my life.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一直是我人生最大的梦想之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:15.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And I'm just super happy that I was able to give my best{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N很开心我能拼尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:17.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and win the match and win this tournament.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N赢下比赛 赢下这个赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:21.67,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}19{\fs68}岁 本季三冠 第一次拿下大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:25.48,TL,,0,0,0,,安德烈耶娃的年终之路 从一月说起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.67,0:00:26.81,TL,,0,0,0,,阿德莱德决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.81,0:00:29.30,TL,,0,0,0,,她从{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}开始连赢{\fs78}9{\fs68}局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:31.33,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下赛季首冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:40.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's Andreeva's title in Adelaide.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安德烈耶娃在阿德莱德夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.46,0:00:46.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A ruthless demolition job on the world number 17.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对世界第{\fs78}17{\fs68}的彻底压制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:48.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Mboko was struggling physically,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N而姆博科身体状况不佳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:52.28,TL,,0,0,520,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}but she has been well and truly put to the sword.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N但她也被对手彻底击溃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:56.54,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网第四轮 她两盘负于斯维托丽娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.73,0:01:00.81,TL,,0,0,0,,春季四站硬地 她都未能走到{\fs78}4{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:04.36,TL,,0,0,0,,林茨决赛 先丢一盘后逆转波塔波娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.36,0:01:06.48,TL,,0,0,0,,她拿下今年第二冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:09.51,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}For the second time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二次冠军点机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:17.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The top seed, the world number 10,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N头号种子 世界第{\fs78}10{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:24.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}has just been able to claim her fifth WTA title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拿下了第五座{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.33,0:01:30.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And how hard that Andreeva has had to work,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N安德烈耶娃付出了多少努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:33.01,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}not just today, but throughout the week.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不仅今天 更是整个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.55,0:01:38.15,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里再进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.15,0:01:40.65,TL,,0,0,0,,却两盘负于科斯秋克
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.93,0:02:01.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A spectacular display of dialed-in determination{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N极其专注而坚定的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:04.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}yields a new queen of the clay in Madrid.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N成就了马德里新红土女王
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:06.40,TL,,0,0,0,,罗马止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.02,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎半决赛 她击败科斯秋克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.02,0:02:12.78,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛战胜赫瓦林斯卡 首夺大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:30.79,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The teenager becomes a champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位少女成为了冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:43.89,TL,,0,0,0,,温网先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:47.76,TL,,0,0,0,,仍被克雷吉茨科娃逆转 止步第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:51.87,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Krejcikova has earned herself another match point.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N克雷吉茨科娃又拿到赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.11,0:03:11.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's that net cord again{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是这次擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.47,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that does for Andreeva.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N让安德烈耶娃败下阵来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.47,0:03:16.67,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The former champion inspired and helped{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位前冠军再次受到鼓舞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.67,0:03:19.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}by Centre Court once again.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N并得到中央球场的助力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.79,TL,,0,0,0,,美网{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:23.05,TL,,0,0,0,,两个赛点没兑现
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:25.32,TL,,0,0,0,,她最终被高芙逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.57,0:03:28.07,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Second match point now for Gauff.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N现在是高芙的第二个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:57.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}9{\fs68}日 她首次获得单打年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:03:59.53,TL,,0,0,0,,两天后的北京决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:01.95,TL,,0,0,0,,是今年第五场决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:05.81,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 收获北京亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:16.39,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And the ultimate exclamation point{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N用最有力的惊叹号
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.39,0:04:18.71,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to conquer the China Open.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N征服中国网球公开赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.96,0:04:22.28,TL,,0,0,0,,北京之后 世界第{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:25.90,TL,,0,0,0,,她因赛程调整退出武汉 下一站年终
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:28.62,TL,,0,0,0,,你期待她走到哪一步？
